  "info": {
    "title": "Asset Tags API",
    "description": "# Overview\nThe Asset Tags API enables programmatic lifecycle management of asset tag keys and values.\n### Key Features\n* Create, read, update, and delete of tag keys and values\n* Bulk upsert and delete of tag values\n* Get tag values by tag id and optional type\n* Get tag values by asset type and id\n\n",
